---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const title = "How to Write Your Memoir, Hollywood Style";
const description =
  "Discover a practical storytelling system for turning your life experiences into a compelling memoir.";

const amazonUrl = "https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GLR2TTDP";
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
  <article>
    <p><a href="/">← Back to home</a></p>

    <h1>How to Write Your Memoir, Hollywood Style</h1>
<p>
  <img
    src="/images/book-cover.jpg"
    alt="Cover of How to Write Your Memoir, Hollywood Style"
    style="max-width: 300px; width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px;"
  />
</p>

    <p>
      Your life contains decades of people, places, decisions, conflicts, and
      turning points. The challenge is not finding enough material. It is
      choosing what belongs in the story and shaping it into a book that readers
      want to continue reading.
    </p>

    <p>
      <em>How to Write Your Memoir, Hollywood Style</em> presents a practical
      method for applying proven storytelling principles to true life
      experiences.
    </p>

    <p>
      <a
        href={amazonUrl}
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="buy-button"
      >
        Buy the Book on Amazon
      </a>
    </p>

    <h2>Who Is This Book For?</h2>

    <p>The book is intended for:</p>

    <ul>
      <li>people writing their first memoir</li>
      <li>writers struggling to organize a lifetime of memories</li>
      <li>families preserving personal histories</li>
      <li>professional memoir writers and ghostwriters</li>
      <li>anyone who wants to tell a true story more effectively</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>What You Will Learn</h2>

    <ul>
      <li>how to choose the right story from your life</li>
      <li>how to identify the central theme of your memoir</li>
      <li>how to structure real experiences into a compelling narrative</li>
      <li>how to create scenes, tension, and emotional momentum</li>
      <li>how to decide what to include and what to leave out</li>
      <li>how to move from an idea toward a finished manuscript</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>A Complete System</h2>

    <p>
      The articles on this website answer individual memoir-writing questions.
      The book brings the process together into one complete system, with
      practical guidance that can be followed from the first idea to the
      finished manuscript.
    </p>

    <h2>Ready to Begin?</h2>

    <p>
      Get the complete step-by-step system and start transforming your memories
      into a memoir.
    </p>

    <p>
      <a
        href={amazonUrl}
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="buy-button"
      >
        Buy the Book on Amazon
      </a>
    </p>
  </article>

  <style>
    .buy-button {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 0.8rem 1.2rem;
      border-radius: 0.35rem;
      background: #222;
      color: #fff;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .buy-button:hover {
      background: #444;
    }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
